00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.080
How to sign in or log in to&nbsp;
your Sun Life provider account?

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.320
So, first of all, all you have to do is&nbsp;
download the Sun Life app on your mobile device.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:13.280
Or you can also visit the Sun&nbsp;
Life login page on the website.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:19.040
Now, inside the Sun Life app, you will see the&nbsp;
"Enter your credentials" option available there.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.520
Input your Access ID and password.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.880
Then, simply click on the&nbsp;
login button available there.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.880
If you have not registered yet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.360
click on "Register" and follow the&nbsp;
prompts to create your account.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:38.800
So here, as you can see, it might take a&nbsp;
few moments for my Sun Life account to load.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.080
And that is it.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.840
If you found this video helpful, please&nbsp;
like, share, and subscribe to our channel.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.040
Thank you so much for watching.

